Build the competing-risks response from the two column pairs. PCM is listed first, so a PCM
diagnosed at the same time as death counts as PCM:

::: {#5e0252e5 .cell execution_count=30}
``` {.python .cell-code}
import greenwood as gw

mgus2 = gw.load_dataset("mgus2")

# The first observed endpoint wins, and ties go to the one listed first
y = gw.Surv.first_event(
    endpoints={"pcm": ("ptime", "pstat"), "death": ("futime", "death")},
    data=mgus2,
)
y
```

