endpoint for `pbc` is:

::: {#779978ea .cell execution_count=50}
``` {.python .cell-code}
pbc = gw.load_dataset("pbc")

# Anything other than 0 is an event
gw.Surv.right(time="time", event="status", data=pbc, censor_value=0)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=50}
```
Surv(type=right, n=418, events=186)
```
:::
